# Mutable per-run learning logs written by the skills at runtime.
# Kept on disk (the skills append to them) but not version-controlled —
# they churn constantly and hold operational run state. Curated
# memory/LESSONS.md files ARE tracked.
**/memory/*-log.jsonl

